{
  "title": { "zh": "再深一倍", "en": "Twice as deep" },
  "after": {
    "zh": "十二层和六层一样好训：每一块一开始都原样通过，训练只需让少数几块学出那一点改动，梯度沿着捷径直达每一层。ResNet 就这样把网络堆到了一百多层。",
    "en": "Twelve layers train as easily as six: every block starts out passing its input straight through, training only has to teach a few of them the small change, and the gradient reaches every layer along the shortcuts. This is how ResNet stacks networks to more than a hundred layers."
  },
  "intro": [
    {
      "t": {
        "zh": "<level-ref to=\"4-16\"></level-ref>里，6 层的网络加上捷径就训得动了。今天认图的网络动辄上百层，再深下去还行吗？",
        "en": "In <level-ref to=\"4-16\"></level-ref>, a 6-layer network trained once it had shortcuts. Today's image-recognition networks run to a hundred layers or more: does it still work deeper down?"
      }
    },
    {
      "t": {
        "zh": "这一关你要做的：把至少 12 个卷积层串成一条路，训练它学会测试里那种轻微的模糊。每个卷积层都从很小的随机数开始。",
        "en": "Your task: chain at least 12 conv layers into one path and train it to learn the light blur in the tests. Every conv layer starts from very small random numbers."
      },
      "fig": { "test": 0, "caption": { "zh": "第一组测试：字母 X → 轻微模糊", "en": "Set 1: the letter X → lightly blurred" } }
    }
  ],
